              "value": "(aura, emotion, fear, mental, necromancy)\n\n30 feet. A living creature that enters the area must succeed at a DC 31 Will save or gain the doomed 1 condition. A critical failure increases this condition to doomed 2. Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to this death coach's aura of doom for 1 minute."
